# <type>(<scope>): <subject> (max 72 chars)
# |<----  Using a Maximum Of 72 Characters  ---->|
#
# Allowed <type> values:
#   feat     (new feature or functionality)
#   fix      (bug fix)
#   docs     (documentation changes only)
#   style    (code style / formatting changes, no production code change)
#   refactor (refactoring code without changing public behavior)
#   perf     (performance improvements)
#   test     (adding or modifying test suites)
#   build    (build system or dependency changes)
#   ci       (continuous integration workflow changes)
#   chore    (general maintenance tasks or tooling overhaul)
#
# Scope examples: cli, orchestrator, sandbox, security, telemetry, llm
#
# Body: Explain *what* and *why*, not *how*.
#
# Footer: Reference issues (e.g. Closes #123) or note breaking changes.
